            <div xml:id="m-b3831ec2-f18c-41d5-8df3-72c99fc4300e">
              <lg xml:id="m-d01d0294-d098-4fbd-983e-ddc07e45eda6">
                <l xml:id="m-081d343d-eb19-4993-ad1d-e15d1db7b5b8" facs="#m-357b3c51-746d-44e4-811a-bde06214127d" label="text-like">At Matins.</l><l xml:id="m-ddb9439c-0bb2-4030-8b01-f0ec38021ea6" facs="#m-918ebdc8-27ca-4a86-9d36-a3a0cf83ce31" label="ambiguous">383</l><l xml:id="m-5a9877bf-7517-4c50-ac22-75bc382b7461" facs="#m-6b1c086f-90be-4e30-b204-669883edd0b5" label="ambiguous">Lesson V.</l><l xml:id="m-0588ebbf-7acd-46d9-a2a5-458ced9cd966" facs="#m-3b76b577-535a-456a-b691-18d5ed5898d4" label="lyrics-like">TN quo conflictu pro nobis inito, l vitátem de carnis concupiscéntia</l><l xml:id="m-151ab486-7196-4ae9-ad89-eb7c71ef5f86" facs="#m-a991e73d-d43c-48a3-9c8c-d2285ebbe10a" label="lyrics-like">L magno et mirábili aequitãtis jure</l><l xml:id="m-13bf0c92-8339-4269-924f-aa993135828f" facs="#m-d4de40f8-9a39-4a08-bdad-ca6281b287e8" label="lyrics-like">transsvit, nihil de peccáti lege ma¬</l><l xml:id="m-0df398a6-0c61-4572-86a1-054d006572a2" facs="#m-308da6b8-b674-4bdf-a3c3-687d19327faf" label="lyrics-like">návit. Virgo régia Davidicae stir¬</l><l xml:id="m-34ca3646-8c6c-4f37-9755-587d4dec871f" facs="#m-73056dda-b4c2-42a0-9e1e-774628ff1dc9" label="lyrics-like">certátũm est, dum omnspotens Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-8d3a63c9-8852-4ea9-a388-4bca3b8e2c46" facs="#m-d3827ed5-6790-40fd-8381-6833b03519f3" label="lyrics-like">pis eligitur, quae sacro gravidánda</l><l xml:id="m-4c1b94a5-1ae2-4ead-8152-da232f28dcba" facs="#m-9fc0bd14-bed8-4157-bc9c-593b89f5e644" label="lyrics-like">minus cum saevíssimo hoste non in</l><l xml:id="m-7ca44b9c-c2d0-42e0-a6cb-d3b2cc1aa673" facs="#m-01319320-e90c-4f3e-a422-925e1b5b0df5" label="lyrics-like">sua majestáte, sed in nostra congré¬</l><l xml:id="m-f53010d6-19c4-4f51-a535-2f55524a6fcb" facs="#m-81c714cc-0750-42c7-acff-59a6de42742c" label="lyrics-like">foetu, divínam humanámque pro¬</l><l xml:id="m-7142cb9a-3041-47ee-97e5-425e7ddbcd2c" facs="#m-08f40d19-f1c0-437d-be56-38502d3fb21f" label="lyrics-like">ditur humilitáte: obiiciens ei eám¬</l><l xml:id="m-35cdea75-df90-4db2-b21a-1b5557a2fcdc" facs="#m-86166fa5-db52-4555-b177-cfc57556dd29" label="ambiguous">lem prius conciperet mente, quam</l><l xml:id="m-6069652e-06eb-4c44-800c-7d5a77410160" facs="#m-d87df00d-7493-40fa-aa6a-c4b40e546295" label="lyrics-like">córpore. Et ne supérni ignára con¬</l><l xml:id="m-63a8c21b-acfc-4a3a-979d-507f8653389d" facs="#m-d64e689a-88c3-4191-ad7a-650e52994991" label="lyrics-like">dem formam, eamdémque natúram,</l><l xml:id="m-27725946-4e70-4200-85ea-8d71b4756d5d" facs="#m-dc42d77f-aa1a-4188-a176-50c85bf3b20b" label="lyrics-like">silii ad inusitátos pavéret affátus,</l><l xml:id="m-63c1e3ee-4e52-4c7b-aef7-6be12251a337" facs="#m-0946d1e6-b3d0-4fbd-8ab6-c7cdd414e722" label="lyrics-like">mortalitátis quidem nostrae partí¬</l><l xml:id="m-d6cee764-f11b-4965-915f-9f9f777ef6fa" facs="#m-3033a6f3-c53e-420c-81fe-d4d7429ce9b5" label="lyrics-like">cipem, sed peccáti totius expértem.</l><l xml:id="m-8bc98173-d346-4541-b99f-bfb01643dfaf" facs="#m-489fcf18-7f36-4033-8463-97123a52f94a" label="lyrics-like">quod in ea operándum erat a Spiri¬</l><l xml:id="m-67c7009a-cb4c-43ce-b512-55103929852a" facs="#m-12054ffe-f57d-4591-873c-4e045e257008" label="lyrics-like">Aliénum quippe ab hac nativitáte</l><l xml:id="m-b415001f-4ecb-4bc6-9bc9-c25bc6742335" facs="#m-e60fba07-9aa4-4b43-b0d0-318098c06de4" label="lyrics-like">tu Sancto, collóquio discit angélico:</l><l xml:id="m-11f633e8-739c-4814-ab76-461abd7e4e8b" facs="#m-1db484cc-74a3-42b2-8e30-949404c691e5" label="lyrics-like">est, quod de ómnibus légitur : Nemo</l><l xml:id="m-0b9013fb-2dbf-4bd3-b9da-ddee424ce357" facs="#m-825fdf31-7cbb-4b8b-937f-f62208b0e1fd" label="lyrics-like">nec damnum credit pudóris, Dei</l><l xml:id="m-e37e2c96-de9d-4072-9408-4209cdd20209" facs="#m-13712bb2-ffce-49ab-8878-9cb7772f7134" label="ambiguous">mundus a sorde, nec infans, cujus</l><l xml:id="m-a2022966-9f47-42a2-b6b9-f1f460e3e917" facs="#m-48b3925b-8da3-475c-90ea-64f43c585287" label="lyrics-like">Génitrix mox futúra. Tu autem,</l><l xml:id="m-6e1d7f33-122f-48a0-80d3-114159865211" facs="#m-c268c87b-5b13-46b9-9895-4c0348db0a89" label="lyrics-like">Dómine, miserére nobis. B. Déo</l><l xml:id="m-a3c62e98-0c88-4ba4-ab06-ece6d34b5a95" facs="#m-6f3d0e5c-c7a1-4dfd-a06a-9d4976f6032c" label="lyrics-like">est unius diéi vita super terram.</l><l xml:id="m-29913383-1029-430f-bf23-90df26615cad" facs="#m-9c7b00b1-eb73-45fc-b7d5-942ec1746223" label="lyrics-like">Nihil ergo in istam singulárem nati- grátias.</l><l xml:id="m-c8374bd0-ded4-4f69-b485-5efcada3376b" facs="#m-39a6ba08-c253-4589-90ae-0872359705b3" label="ambiguous">5. Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-7df74d09-5949-48e3-9596-e6d1ec1905b5" facs="#m-368ee588-4649-40b0-bfd8-7caf4eccb5ff" label="ambiguous">7</l><l xml:id="m-f4749e3e-0a4b-4e72-b2a9-542e5a44c33e" facs="#m-6ba257c4-6a08-4520-b39b-9ca771accf59" label="ambiguous">B EA</l><l xml:id="m-24b8fee0-55ce-4271-aea0-c37f0188b050" facs="#m-31cdc3e8-d420-48d1-9c4a-ffd702c3c04f" label="lyrics-like">ta “Dé- i Génitrix Ma-rí¬</l><l xml:id="m-8a1c9534-2cbd-4097-a630-f7aa6c2634c2" facs="#m-c90bc7dc-61ce-48a8-8a15-dadd8fab659a" label="lyrics-like">a, cú-jus</l><l xml:id="m-1ac612cd-5e85-4541-b73d-d84ec5d9f1e2" facs="#m-7df53ab2-d29c-44b5-8a06-6a208ea4234f" label="lyrics-like">nent: "Hó-di¬ e</l><l xml:id="m-59f9ce82-a5b5-4c2a-b5e3-e570c145b4fa" facs="#m-e8198001-02b5-4606-9f7f-68024a5e9008" label="lyrics-like">vísce¬</l><l xml:id="m-237c56e4-7601-4132-9f95-d5f2813711e2" facs="#m-0620b4bf-932b-41d3-b97a-01aab8273332" label="lyrics-like">ra intá- cta pérma¬</l><l xml:id="m-a789efb9-ad82-4530-b3e4-f3d4bd5ecb85" facs="#m-f5eb7416-c345-45fb-b2a0-c9df0c353d66" label="lyrics-like">li. V. Be-á¬ ta,</l><l xml:id="m-239e1e41-3baf-46d4-87ce-00d48c65cf68" facs="#m-e636f26b-bff3-400a-b5d9-f9f2da9256b3" label="lyrics-like">gé- nu-it Salvató-rem saé-cu¬</l><l xml:id="m-8d680e30-e23e-4c27-8ef4-85b2d257542e" facs="#m-7af9bee0-0459-4502-872e-18668f3151df" label="lyrics-like">quae crédi-dit: quóni-am perfécta sunt ómni¬ a, quae</l><l xml:id="m-5f30c149-7bfc-4d2e-8cdf-c8b672625f6c" facs="#m-9f2e3346-872b-4624-97b4-d573d68211f9" label="lyrics-like">"Hódi¬ e</l><l xml:id="m-073960d8-aa7e-435b-b1bd-ab99e2bd7302" facs="#m-ed0d0d3d-a347-44f0-9a9f-d3a6d1d82616" label="lyrics-like">dí-cta sunt é¬i</l><l xml:id="m-264f325a-c854-4dd3-aa0f-3b979d211699" facs="#m-1a958ef3-816d-4d76-8d4d-5f331f3f1af7" label="lyrics-like">aDó- mi- no.</l><l xml:id="m-146ccc24-e140-449a-88b8-ae7c5a229fd5" facs="#m-dc2ecfb0-4c4c-4c38-ba98-59fc2ab355d7" label="text-like">The Lector : Jube, domne, benedicere.</l><l xml:id="m-38905607-e6fd-4fd0-bea4-7b2281fe46db" facs="#m-0463b4a1-562f-4f30-950d-d69878395674" label="lyrics-like">Blessing. Ignem sui amóris * accéndat Deus in córdibus nostris.</l><l xml:id="m-da49e58b-1a76-4e1c-a337-3bfe8bb27112" facs="#m-4f6576b9-d183-447a-bc59-dc1b81662a9d" label="ambiguous">H. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-c6fb569c-5d6a-450b-905a-d95721410537" facs="#m-1947c677-30c3-4522-9d73-645f64fee9e5" label="ambiguous">Lesson VI.</l><l xml:id="m-cf3089f1-47dd-4dcc-8949-7c8789e3799f" facs="#m-d068d865-51e9-4ae4-92b0-5a8328949c74" label="lyrics-like">TGámus ergo, dilectíssimi, grâ-¡ nos, misértus est nostri: et cum</l><l xml:id="m-3fffab25-e760-423d-a605-e497a95d01c4" facs="#m-edb79f6a-ecdc-4c28-a5a8-5a8bbbd04cac" label="lyrics-like">A tias Deo Patri, per Filium ejus lessémus mórtui peccátis, convivifi¬</l><l xml:id="m-bbcc2d80-7364-41bc-a3b7-e92469e60778" facs="#m-7f2631ef-f631-43b1-95da-fd204e956e9a" label="lyrics-like">in Spiritu Sancto : qui propter mul-Icávit nos Christo, ut essémus in</l><l xml:id="m-3f1fe7e4-1b1b-4eee-a6b0-a20c8e9dd886" facs="#m-58ccec54-83ca-4e74-929d-7e23ac44d08b" label="lyrics-like">tam caritátem suam, qua diléxit lipso nova creatúra, novúmque fig¬</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>